  "name": "Question 5",
  "problem": "If $Y={0}$, then $P(Y)=$",
  "worked_solution": "The power set of $Y,$ denoted $P(Y),$ is the set that contains every possible subset of $Y,$ including the empty set $\u2205.$\n\nSo, let's list out the subsets of $Y:$\n\n- The subset with no elements is $\u2205.$\n\n- The subset with $1$ element is $Y$ itself: ${0}.$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\nP(Y)={\u2205,{0}}.\n$$",
